# Apple Silicon (M1+): Whisper large-v3-turbo on the GPU through MLX; Slovak sources use the kinit fine-tune on the CPU.
# Measured 2026-11-07 on an M1 Pro: German 4.4% / English 5.4% word error, ~0.72 s per recognition call (see documentation/BENCHMARKS.md).
BP_STT_ENGINE=mlx_whisper
BP_SK_STT_MODEL=ct2_models/whisper-large-v3-turbo-sk
BP_PROSODY=1
